title: "Legislative Scraper Hidalgo"
message: >
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it using
  the metadata from this file.
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Islas Ruiz"
    given-names: "Alan Suah"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0299-4673"

abstract: >
  Legislative Scraper Hidalgo is an open-source workflow for extracting,
  organizing, and analyzing legislative activity data from the Congress
  of the State of Hidalgo (Mexico). The repository contains reproducible
  R scripts for data collection, preprocessing, and productivity analysis
  of legislative interventions.

keywords:
  - legislative studies
  - web scraping
  - R
  - legislature
  - Hidalgo
  - Mexico
  - political science
  - open science
  - reproducible research

